{
  "about": "The .NET idiom map for the surface check: how each entry of Python's surface.json (spec/surface.json) is found in this SDK's public API. A name not listed here follows the rule: snake_case becomes PascalCase, an async method gains Async, an argument in seconds (timeout_s) is a TimeSpan without the suffix (timeout), a resource is the type MfxHub.<Resource> reached as MfxClient.<Resource>, and an event is the type MfxHub.<Event>. Keep it to the exceptions. pending holds what Enriched has not landed yet, by resource, method, errors.<Name> or events.<Name>, each with the pull request's Task that brings it.",
